      "raw_text": "This paper is included in the Proceedings of the 31st USENIX Security Symposium. August 10-12, 2022 • Boston, MA, USA 978-1-939133-31-1 Open access to the Proceedings of the 31st USENIX Security Symposium is sponsored by USENIX.",
